sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as Application or Coach
  participant Gateway as Action gateway
  participant DB as Owned context and receipts
  participant PRISM as Existing PRISM workflow
  participant Views as Today and Library
  User->>UI: Tailor CV for this application
  UI->>Gateway: Typed action and context revisions
  Gateway->>DB: Validate owner, revisions, entitlement, idempotency
  alt Existing result or in-progress run
    DB-->>Gateway: Same run or durable result
    Gateway-->>UI: Resume or open existing artifact
  else New valid request
    Gateway->>DB: Persist run and reserve documented usage
    Gateway->>PRISM: Analyze with owned source snapshot
    PRISM-->>UI: Actual stage and clarification questions
    User->>UI: Confirm missing facts or decline assertion
    UI->>Gateway: Reviewed answers bound to input revision
    Gateway->>PRISM: Generate and review
    PRISM->>DB: Persist checkpoints and draft result
    alt Checkpoint or artifact persistence fails
      Gateway->>DB: Record recoverable failure
      Gateway-->>UI: Retry or resume with same identity
    else Draft ready
      PRISM-->>UI: Draft, evidence gaps and actual result
      User->>UI: Review and accept artifact
      Gateway->>DB: Persist CV link and durable result receipt
      Gateway->>PRISM: Finalize existing run
      Gateway->>DB: Reconcile usage and emit domain event
      DB-->>Views: Invalidate projections and update action
      Gateway-->>UI: Completed with owned artifact link
    end
  end
